        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, as our precision oncology portfolio leverages our methylation platform, we believe we are differentiated by the extent of the quality of our methylation platform and our investments to develop such platform through our population-scale clinical studies, rigorous analytics and machine learning expertise.",
